+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 watch with a numeric deep on a reactive object, a ref and an array (packages/runtime-core/__tests__/apiWatch.spec.ts) [AC-1]
+- [ ] 1.2 watch on a shallowReactive object, and on a reactive object with deep: false (packages/runtime-core/__tests__/apiWatch.spec.ts) [AC-2]
+
+## 2. Fix
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Accept a number for deep and pass it to traverse as the depth (packages/runtime-core/src/apiWatch.ts)
+- [ ] 2.2 Traverse a shallow reactive source at its root level only (packages/runtime-core/src/apiWatch.ts)
